      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1932857088281059837",
      "text": "[6:41PM] #Masha_Aguda #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic flow on Eric Moore inward and outward journey to Iganmu Bridge and Doyin, with unhindered movement observed on the Eric Moore inward route to Bode Thomas junction.\n\nUncongested roads along the stretch of Babs Animashaun, facilitating good movement in both inward and outward directions towards Census and Doyin.\n\nEfficient traffic management at Census inward Aiyetoro down to Brown, with signalized traffic light control at NEPA ensuring a smooth flow of traffic.\n\nGood movement observed on various routes, including Aguda to Pako to Ijesha Market, Otun Oba to Lawanson/Ogunlana down to Ojuelegba, Census journey to Agboyin/Adelabu to Kilo down to Nnobi, and Onilegogoro to Masha with a similarly smooth return journey.\n\nUnimpeded traffic flow on Ogunlana to Cele Okota link bridge inward Cele service lane and Oshodi Expressway, with both routes operating in good order.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
